<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111881" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλύω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ.</span> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφλύω</span>] and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλύζω</span></b> , aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφλῠσα</span>
		v. infr. <i><span class="en">
			11
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλέω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boil over, bubble up</i>: hence,
				<i>burst out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇσι φλυζούσῃσι
			αἱμορραγίῃσι</span> (Foes for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφύζουσι
				αἱμορραγέσι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				2.3.14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλύω</span> expld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυκαρπέω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				3.41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>overflow with words, babble,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάτην φλύσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					504
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράμματα ἐπ᾽ ἀσπίδος φλύοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					661
				</span></i>
			: c.acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήμην στυγερὴν ἔφλῠσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.351
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Diosc.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφλῠσε</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔβλυσε</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				352
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>(?)); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανίης ὕπο μυρία φλύζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					214
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλύοντ᾽ ἀνθηρῇ σὺν
			κακοδαιμονίῃ</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aet.
				5.8
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			 or 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλύεται,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγραίνεται</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.152
			</span></i>.</div>
